//　堀越公方足利茶々丸の血の半分は蝦夷のもの。
//　すなわち<RUBY text='か'>彼</RUBY>の将帥は<RUBY text='ハーフドワーフ'>半蝦夷</RUBY>である――と。
  It is a well-known rumor, though not spoken anywhere the Kamakura Watch might overhear. They say that she was a bastard child, that half her blood is dwarven. Tainted.

