//間違いなく膨大な数の死者は出る。

//　下手をすれば、過去の銀星号事件の被害者が<RUBY text='・・'>端数</RUBY>に
//思える程の――
  Where does that leave me!?

  I struggle for an answer, but none is forthcoming. I've heard that there are ways to escape a full Nelson, but I lack the requisite knowledge―and am not in a position to read up on it.

  Escape would appear impossible.

  But what then? Is that an excuse to surrender?

  Is surrender even an option?

  If I fail here, the bomb will fall. I don't know whether this will truly summon a god, but there seems little room to doubt that many people will die. Perhaps enough to make Ginseigo's massacres pale in comparison.

